WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:03.500
Huzza! All votes have now been cast,

cue-2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.900
The victor's laurels gained at last.

cue-3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:10.300
In an old armchair aloft he soars:

cue-4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.000
No candidate could wish for more.

cue-5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.000
The election's won, the day's his own,

cue-6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.500
Through all the town the winner's shown.

cue-7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.500
But careful, sirs, who bear his weight

cue-8
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.819
Lest the Member meet a dreadful Fate.
